WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Choose filtered Excel for matching records, a briefing PDF for a scoped summary, or an impact PDF for traced relationships.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Explorer Excel exports include every row matching the selected scope and Explorer filters, across all pages.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Governance briefing PDFs use applied header scope and the loaded snapshot. Explorer search does not narrow the briefing.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Choose a starting CI or matching results in Topology Explorer. Export the full traced graph and supporting evidence, with the scope and snapshot.
